<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Cryptdeck: third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 52rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 13px; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #8884; border-radius: 6px; }
  li { margin: 0.15rem 0; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Cryptdeck itself is licensed under either the MIT license or the Apache
License 2.0, at your option (see LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE). It is built
from the following open-source Rust crates, whose licenses require these
notices to be shipped with it.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Licenses</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section id="{{id}}">
  <h3>{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul>
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}

<h2>Other components</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Iced-Icons font</strong>, built into the app by the iced GUI
    library (iced_graphics): generated with <a href="https://fontello.com">Fontello</a>,
    licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, whose text is included in
    the font's own metadata.</li>
  <li><strong>AppImage runtime</strong> (only in the AppImage download):
    <a href="https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime">AppImage type2-runtime</a>,
    MIT license.</li>
</ul>
</body>
</html>
